                "word": "Aphrodite",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d1bd00f2-1065-3aa3-bf15-a7d5de55dc2e",
                        "entry_id": "2fcd547d-fc53-3404-a624-555334a38553",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The goddess of beauty and love, born when Cronus castrated his father, Uranus, and threw his genitalia into the sea."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Greek"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9f6c5f3a-a36c-4b7c-a126-1af85218e5b0",
                                "sense_id": "d1bd00f2-1065-3aa3-bf15-a7d5de55dc2e",
                                "text": "In the \"Iliad\", Aphrodite is represented as the daughter of Zeus and Dione, the goddess of moisture, who, as the wife of the god of heaven, was held in high esteem among the old Pelasgians."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d35878bd-12ea-385b-be4f-beaee89230e9",
                        "entry_id": "2fcd547d-fc53-3404-a624-555334a38553",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A female given name from Ancient Greek."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "40b1ddf8-8d3e-431f-a239-81675cfc0746",
                                "sense_id": "d35878bd-12ea-385b-be4f-beaee89230e9",
                                "text": "Aphrodite Jones is an American author and TV producer."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
